<p> 5   Colonial Coml	 122.95   2.25</p>
<p> 6   Adel Bton Cement    120.29   1.66</p>
<p> 7   Forrestania Gold     86.02   2.40</p>
<p> 8   Herald Rsc	     85.84   0.97</p>
